## Development

```bash
git clone https://github.com/hyunjun6928-netizen/salmalm.git
cd salmalm
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest tests/ -q --timeout=30 -x \
  --ignore=tests/test_multi_tenant.py \
  --ignore=tests/test_fresh_install_e2e.py
```

